Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.20,0:00:05.40,Note,,0,0,0,,(至今走过的路)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.50,0:07:11.65,Note,,0,0,0,,《邪恶力量》
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.60,0:42:15.35,Note,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.92,0:00:08.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一生都在寻找这个恶魔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look, our whole lives we've been searching for this demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.60,0:00:18.68,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在终于有了线索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We finally know where this demon's gonna be...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.68,0:00:20.12,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也知道如何结果它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and now we know how to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.12,0:00:21.77,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要结束这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This ends now. I'm ending it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.77,0:00:22.94,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定要结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't care what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.94,0:00:24.56,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论用什么方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No matter what method
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.55,0:00:26.05,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}幻象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A vision
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.05,0:00:27.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管我看到没看到 事实是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Visions or no visions, the fact is...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.45,0:00:28.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个恶魔今晚就会出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the demon is coming tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.75,0:00:31.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而那家人会像我们一样经历一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And this family's gonna go through the same hell we went through.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.32,0:00:33.17,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们知道你有那把枪 约翰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We know you have the gun, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.17,0:00:34.77,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你刚刚是在向我们宣战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You just declared war.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.85,0:00:35.82,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会给你们柯尔特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l'll bring you the Colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.90,0:00:36.74,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个恶魔今晚就会来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The demon is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.74,0:00:37.73,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们只有那把枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That gun is all we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.73,0:00:40.01,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想给梅格一把假枪 指望她不会发现？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hand Meg a fake gun, hope she doesn't notice
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.01,0:00:41.66,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们等待这一仗很长时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've been waiting a long time for this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.66,0:00:44.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 今晚没人会死 我们不会 那家人也不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nobody's dying tonight. Not us, not that family.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.70,0:00:45.98,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么不把枪交出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why don't you hand over the gun
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.00,0:00:47.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许我该射你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Maybe l'll just shoot you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.30,0:00:48.77,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来的可不止我一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's more where l came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.20,0:00:51.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.96,0:00:56.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不敢相信你竟然射了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can't believe you just shot me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.90,0:00:57.73,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是赝品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.43,0:01:04.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sam, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.15,0:01:05.45,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 让我去 它还在里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let me go. It's still in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.48,0:01:07.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你进去就是自杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You get in there It's suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.00,0:01:07.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不在乎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.75,0:01:08.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在乎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:13.73,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那东西杀死了杰西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That thing killed Jess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.73,0:01:14.57,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杀死了妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That thing killed Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.57,0:01:17.08,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她们都已经不在了 再也不会回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're gone. And they're never coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.08,0:01:19.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}经历了那么多事 不许你再这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't you say that.Not after all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.30,0:01:34.33,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们俩这次可真把事给搞砸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You boys really screwed up this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.03,0:01:38.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where is he
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.60,0:01:42.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们永远也见不到你们父亲了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're never gonna see your father again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.65,0:01:47.04,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们抓住了爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They've got Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.00,0:01:50.33,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}梅格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Meg
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.57,0:01:52.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她说什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What'd she say
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.25,0:01:53.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我刚跟你说了 萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l just told you, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.35,0:01:55.97,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.07,0:01:58.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:07.37,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在干嘛 迪恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you doing, Dean
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.10,0:02:08.75,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们必须离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.70,0:02:11.57,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.30,0:02:13.73,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为那个恶魔知道我们在拯救郡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The demon knows we're in Salvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.77,0:02:15.37,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他还知道柯尔特在我们身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It knows we've got the Colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.38,0:02:17.03,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在它抓了爸爸 很可能下一个就来找咱们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}lt's got Dad. lt's coming for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.07,0:02:19.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那才好 我们还有三发子弹 让它来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good. We've got three bullets left.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.23,0:02:20.52,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 勇士 我们还没有准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Listen, we're not ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.53,0:02:22.31,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们也不知道它们有多少人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We don't know how many of them are out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.33,0:02:24.37,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是我们死了 就什么也做不成了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now, we're no good to anybody dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.56,0:02:26.97,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们走… 立刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're leaving. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.60,0:02:39.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我告诉你 迪恩 我们可以结果那家伙的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l'm telling you, we could've taken them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.13,0:02:40.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们需要的是一个计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What we need is a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.35,0:02:42.85,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关键是它们还没杀死爸爸 我们要找到关他的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They're probably keeping Dad alive. Just gotta figure out where.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.88,0:02:44.37,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们想用爸爸来换枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They'll wanna trade him for the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.80,0:02:47.34,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.35,0:02:50.62,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果真是那样的话 为什么梅格一点不提交易的事呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dean, if that were true. why didn't Meg mention a trade
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.68,0:02:55.82,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 爸爸他可能 - 不要说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}-  Dad, he might be - Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.85,0:02:57.88,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也不愿意这是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look, l don't wanna believe it any more than you...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.92,0:03:01.68,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但如果真是这样 我们就更该杀了这个恶魔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but if he is, all the more reason to kill this damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.72,0:03:04.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}柯尔特还在我们手上 我们还有机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We still have the Colt. We can finish the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.18,0:03:05.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在不是谈这件事的时候 萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Screw the job, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.38,0:03:07.52,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 我只是觉得该做爸爸想让我们做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm just trying to do what he'd want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.52,0:03:09.15,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他一定会希望我们继续的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He would want us to keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.15,0:03:11.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能不能别再说得好像他已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Quit talking about him like he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.38,0:03:12.52,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Listen to me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.55,0:03:14.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我们救他回来之前 其他一切免谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}everything stops until we get him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.10,0:03:16.35,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你明白吗 一切事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you understand me Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.40,0:03:21.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 那你准备怎么找他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So how do we find him
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.73,0:03:23.03,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们去林肯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We go to Lincoln.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.07,0:03:25.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从他被抓走的那个仓库开始找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Start at the warehouse where he was taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.33,0:03:27.73,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真觉得恶魔会在那里留下线索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on. You really think these demons are gonna leave a trail
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.77,0:03:29.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 它不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.27,0:03:33.47,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们得找人帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.23,0:04:01.23,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.30,0:04:04.93,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么东西 圣水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is this, holy water
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.97,0:04:07.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那瓶是 这瓶是威士忌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That one is. This is whiskey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.30,0:04:16.57,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 鲍比 感谢你所做的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bobby, thanks. Thanks for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.60,0:04:19.07,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说真的 我不知道我们该不该来这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l wasn't sure if we should come.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.10,0:04:20.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别说傻话 你们父亲需要帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nonsense. Your daddy needs help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.93,0:04:22.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上次我们来这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, but last time we saw you, I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.13,0:04:24.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的确威胁说要用铅弹打爆他的头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you did threaten to blast him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.33,0:04:26.13,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还把散弹枪什么的都用上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You cocked the shotgun and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.17,0:04:28.97,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 没错 我不否认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, well, what can I say
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.00,0:04:31.03,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰就是有那种能耐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}John just has that effect on people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.07,0:04:33.60,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 他的确有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah, I guess he does.
