Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.74,0:36:49.67,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}碍着什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}ln the way of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.81,0:36:52.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我为你制定的计划萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My plans for you, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.10,0:36:56.91,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你… 以及所有和你一样的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You and all of the children like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.94,0:37:00.57,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 你能不能快点说完？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Listen, you mind justgetting this over with, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.61,0:37:03.24,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 因为我实在无法忍受你的独角戏了 - 真有趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}-  l really can't stand the monologuing. - Funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.27,0:37:06.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就是你的作风是不是？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But that's all part ofyour m.o., isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.40,0:37:11.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}掩饰所有痛苦 掩饰所有事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Masks all that nasty pain.Masks the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.00,0:37:13.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 是吗？是什么呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, yeah? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.00,0:37:16.40,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你明白的 你努力 你一直在为这个家庭而努力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know, you fight and you fightfor this family, but the truth is..
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.40,0:37:17.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但事实是 他们根本不需要你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}they don't need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.10,0:37:21.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不像你需要他们那样需要你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not like you need them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.00,0:37:29.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 他显然才是约翰的最爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sam, he's clearly John's favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.31,0:37:31.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使他们争吵不休\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even when they fight
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.87,0:37:35.14,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他对萨姆的关心在任何时候都比对你的要多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it's more concernthan he's ever shown you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.27,0:37:39.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我猜你肯定也为你的子女骄傲 啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll bet you're real proudof your kids too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.50,0:37:44.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 等一下 我忘了 我废了它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, wait, l forgot.I wasted them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.77,0:38:01.21,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.81,0:38:05.44,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.78,0:38:11.37,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad.Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.60,0:38:14.94,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.97,0:38:18.01,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸 不要让他杀了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad. Don't you let it kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.61,0:38:21.24,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.20,0:38:36.84,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸 不要啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.71,0:38:46.14,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.34,0:38:51.07,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No! Don't! Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.10,0:38:52.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.47,0:39:05.14,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你杀了我 就杀了爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You kill me, you kill Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.70,0:39:07.97,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.70,0:39:21.37,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 迪恩 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dean. Dean. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.41,0:39:23.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 上帝 你流了很多血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, God. You lost a lot of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.50,0:39:24.10,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where's Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.07,0:39:27.17,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在这 他在这 迪恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's right here, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.21,0:39:28.90,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 去看看他 - 迪恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Go check on him. - Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.00,0:39:31.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去看看他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go check on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.87,0:39:40.95,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.37,0:39:44.01,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.04,0:39:46.34,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 它还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sammy! lt's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.99,0:39:49.70,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还在我身体里 我能感觉到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's inside me. I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.00,0:39:51.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你射我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just shoot me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.27,0:39:54.74,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快射我 瞄准我的心脏 儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You shoot me. You shoot me in the heart, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.97,0:39:56.22,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}开枪 马上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.22,0:39:59.44,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 不要 不要 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sam, don't you do it. Don't you do it.You gotta hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.10,0:40:05.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不能坚持太久 开枪吧 儿子 快开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can't hold onto it much longer.Just shoot me, son. Shoot me!I
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.31,0:40:08.37,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 我求你了 此时此地 我们能结束一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Son, l'm begging you.We can end this, here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.77,0:40:10.55,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sammy!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.10,0:40:14.83,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 萨姆 不要 - 你必须做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}-  Sam, no. - You do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.65,0:40:18.22,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sammy!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.30,0:40:22.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sam.Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.44,0:41:07.50,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 坚持住 行吗 只要10分钟就到医院了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look, just hold on, all right?The hospital's only 10 minutes away.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.31,0:41:13.04,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很惊讶 萨姆 你为什么不杀死它？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm surprised at you, Sammy.Why didn't you kill it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.37,0:41:15.25,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以为对此我们早就达成共识了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought we saw eye to eye on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.25,0:41:16.94,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杀死这个恶魔第一重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Killing this demon comes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.97,0:41:19.64,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比我或者任何事都重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Before me, before everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.21,0:41:26.00,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 父亲 那不是最重要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, sir.Not before everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.64,0:41:29.20,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 我们还有柯尔特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Look, we still got the Colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.34,0:41:30.97,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们还有一发子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We still have the one bullet left.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.01,0:41:32.99,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们只需重头再来一次 是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We should start over, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.99,0:41:34.30,中上英下,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们已经找到这个恶魔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}l mean, we already found the demon once
